  "title": "Arochukwu/Ohafia federal constituency",
  "content": "Arochukwu/Ohafia is a federal constituency in Abia State, Nigeria. It covers Arochukwu and Ohafia local government areas. Arochukwu/Ohafia is represented by Ibe Osonwa of the Labour Party of Nigeria.\n\n\n== References ==",
